len_Eindhoven" title="Overleg sjabloon"><img resource="https://nl.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bestand:OOjs_UI_icon_speechBubbles-ltr.svg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/40/OOjs_UI_icon_speechBubbles-ltr.svg/20px-OOjs_UI_icon_speechBubbles-ltr.svg.png?utm_source=nl.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/40/OOjs_UI_icon_speechBubbles-ltr.svg/40px-OOjs_UI_icon_speechBubbles-ltr.svg.png?utm_source=nl.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" alt="Overleg sjabloon" data-file-width="20" data-file-height="20" data-file-type="drawing" height="16" width="16" class="mw-file-element"/></a></span> · <span typeof="mw:File" data-mw='{"caption":"Sjabloon bewerken"}'><a href="https://nl.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Sjabloon:Navigatie_stadsdelen_Eindhoven&amp;action=edit" data-mw-original-href="//nl.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Sjabloon:Navigatie_stadsdelen_Eindhoven&amp;action=edit" title="Sjabloon bewerken"><img resource="https://nl.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bestand:OOjs_UI_icon_edit-ltr.svg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8a/OOjs_UI_icon_edit-ltr.svg/20px-OOjs_UI_icon_edit-ltr.svg.png?utm_source=nl.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8a/OOjs_UI_icon_edit-ltr.svg/40px-OOjs_UI_icon_edit-ltr.svg.png?utm_source=nl.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" alt="Sjabloon bewerken" data-file-width="20" data-file-height="20" data-file-type="drawing" height="16" width="16" class="mw-file-element"/></a></span></span></div></div>
